    <h2>Single item vs household cleanout</h2>
    <p>A single old laptop is a routine request. A full household cleanout — moving out, downsizing, sorting years of accumulated electronics — is a different scale of job.</p>
    <p>For household cleanouts, give 2-3 working days notice, share photos of the collection area, and mention if there are any oversized items (old CRT TVs, large speakers, defunct refrigerators). Cleanouts often benefit from a longer on-site visit rather than the fast in-and-out of a single-item pickup.</p>
  </section>

